{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:14 2026-10-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:14 2026-10-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:14 2026-10-23 HKT</p><img alt=\"「合夥智能」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/e125eab69605683dd3f05d737e92403a/2026-10/179273232359309.jpg\"/><p>今早從化試閘，部分騎練北上打點旗下馬出試及處理從化廄務；不過，呂健威則留守沙田馬場工作，當三匹參戰馬「禪勝閃亮」、「君至酷」及「合夥智能」在大圈出試時，威哥更細心逐一舉鏡吼實。</p><p>值得一提，今早何澤堯到場只替「合夥智能」一匹有程馬出試，可見對牠十分重視。「合夥智能」上仗季內初出，配何澤堯跑田草千二米，僅輸頸位跑獲季軍，表現出色；今戰出爭第五場同程賽事，有力贏馬補中。</p><img alt=\"「君至酷」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3dbf90a590e549bb968f51508154e949/2026-10/179273238370227.jpg\" title=\"「君至酷」\"/><p>「君至酷」</p><img alt=\"「禪勝閃亮」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/912e787a7a980e45538955168a0cd461/2026-10/179273238432590.jpg\" title=\"「禪勝閃亮」\"/><p>「禪勝閃亮」</p><img alt=\"呂健威\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/21b6668d0446fc5d77321580266a4177/2026-10/179273238464274.jpg\" title=\"呂健威\"/><p>呂健威</p><p>陳嘉甜</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:43:51.968433+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":287,"images":4,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:14:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T07:58:40.676596+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:21.948335+00:00","content_hash":"98cf4fd88bdaae70ff06ad19ed4c4799470569fa9a876f2b1d2395cd5685d2ec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}